# ─── Reddit OAuth (for the Trending watcher's Reddit source) ───
# Reddit blocks unauthenticated .json requests from server IPs (403). The trending
# plugin fetches through /api/reddit, which uses app-only OAuth (client_credentials).
#
# Create credentials at https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
#   1. "Create another app..." → choose type "script"
#   2. name: anything (e.g. bpd-situation-monitor)
#   3. redirect uri: http://localhost:3000  (required field; unused for app-only auth)
#   4. After creating: the id under the app name is your CLIENT_ID; "secret" is CLIENT_SECRET
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values, then restart `npm run dev`.

REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Reddit asks for a descriptive User-Agent. Format: platform:appid:version (by /u/username)
REDDIT_USER_AGENT=web:bpd-situation-monitor:v0.1 (by /u/yourname)
